Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Gather round, come take a look...{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}It's time for Theatre of Darkness.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\i1}Laundry{\i0}{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the story of a woman consumed by endless chores...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there were clothes lying around in the living room!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to put them in the laundry basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to wear this tomorrow, so hurry up and wash it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a stain on it, but it'll come out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom has plenty of free time anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You are always nagging.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear you, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Honestly,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where on earth did they pick this up...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It looks like this one will take some time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do this one too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:00:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave some dinner out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one in my family knows,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but every day,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am washing away grudges.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good work as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An accident...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A re-wash again...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From the grudges brought home by my family,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to the lingering desires of passersby...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a job that someone has to do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And every single day at that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.27,0:02:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I was washing weird things every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You too...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone ends up broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,wash this out for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm telling you, they broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They vanished...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think it's actually quite a fascinating view?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}THE END{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Note: This episode uses a macabre metaphor where doing laundry represents washing away negative emotions, grudges (onnen), and lingering desires brought home by family members or absorbed from strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The protagonist and other homemakers are bound to this invisible task every day, but the relentless burden eventually breaks them mentally, causing them to lose their minds or vanish entirely.
